=== Prompt ===
Who is Orinthia Dawnspear?

=== Response ===
Orinthia Dawnspear is a fictional character from the Warhammer Fantasy Battle universe, specifically from the game Warhammer Age of Sigmar. She is a Stormcast Eternal, a group of immortal heroes who fight against the forces of Chaos. Orinthia is a Libator, a type of Stormcast Eternal who is skilled in the arts of diplomacy and negotiation. She carries a relic known as the Dawnspear, which is said to have been forged from the first ray of sunlight after the world was created. The Dawnspear grants her the ability to turn the tide of battle and bring hope to her allies. Orinthia is a popular character in the Warhammer Age of Sigmar community due to her unique abilities and backstory.

